Description: Complete button-first desktop suite for ClockworkPi uConsole
 Native Qt Quick desktop, terminal, Music, Video, Browser, Reader and Emulator
 applications. Adds a labwc session and selects uDeck Terminal as the system
 default terminal. Targets the official CM4 v3.1 arm64 / Debian 13 image.
